<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-10T10:08:44.372Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:08:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan condemned a Houthi strike on the Saudi Aramco building in Riyadh and demanded an end to all Houthi attacks on Saudi Arabia, while a separate Houthi attempt on the same facility was also thwarted. In northwest Pakistan a police officer was killed in a terror attack, and a Pakistani military drone strike in Balochistan’s Kachhi district killed five fighters including a commander. Punjab officials linked regional smog to cross-border Diwali fireworks from India, prompting an LPG strike call to be withdrawn and later postponed after talks. The conflict still accounts for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBNZzNQclRGYW16U1BnbUJVLUdobjVKX0stSHhnQl9obnZnYUdLMWFkaUlhSV9IbFlXaTQ1SVd1TjNlcHpPdXJKOQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-_?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hindustan Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQLXpGVVZhLVM3Y1RxWlhVRkh3bDh1YzVEZS1MbFN4WUV2LVo2MjJsZE1iRUExRDFlOUI1T2lDMHhzeUtDdFdQQjVmUVROR2RaMURRZGozeUtSYkltT3RFbERVSEkzbUJEZFM4alczRW96a1hwQTN5UW9rOVJPaEtleGZxdmo1Ym80X1pJZFNBaVUtUmZPd0Vlc3RkTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UrduPoint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Indian Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANI News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOTVVVYzJERWhYZ3Bhb3NTV0cyY2t2bHdNcW5fMkdGN09iZlg1OE90Rl9JTlhoVUtibmVhTEp5b3FSTzU4dzN4WExLVjFUUXh5d3JUMXRHeVZrbnBPRHJ4TEZ6RE5jNkt4VmdGc1dxZHcwTG5vaDhHa3FyZlZSM3dDbTFNaWxBTHpRQ0lvMGRidDBHb0Y3Ty16SVlaZmw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UrduPoint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxNZEFKb0pqUkpFZERkU2tQUlA3NFppYTdiTElxek9xV1dONURXZW